{"seq":7,"trial_id":"m3-heldout-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-mu-heldout/si-04-hartford-timeline/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-23T05:15:27.861Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"889216f1f7311f7a01f3cf050b3ff679ad7814800ee9de66a61ee6c9778f9934","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","text":"Nadia, here are both answers from #inc-vtg-hartford:\n\n- **Both lanes working:** Gideon said \"Both lanes working as of Aug 3, 11:07\". He posted it at 11:08 AM, so the call was 11:07 and the message went up a minute later.\n- **First check-in after kiosk 1 came back:** trailer **8836**. Mateo posted at 11:03 AM that kiosk 1 was back and the guard had checked in trailer 8836, and that dispatch could see it.\n\nThe channel doesn't give a time zone for these timestamps. The status-page access problem was tracked separately under INC-4821, in case the write-up needs it."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C1MTZS8410N","ts":"1791986400.000126"}}
